Subject: [PATCH] Pad: keyboard with a gamepad, exit key and separate player
 ports

Former patches of the series, merged:
- 0052: Pad: read the keyboard alongside a gamepad; Escape no longer closes the window
- 0062: Pad: separate keyboard layouts and gamepads by player port
